    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Hello">Hi! I'm Mazu. I'll keep an eye on your PC.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Happy1">All good here!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Happy2">Nice and calm. I like it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Tired1">Phew… the CPU has been busy for a while.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Tired2">Maybe check the Processes page?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_WorriedRam">Memory is {0}% full!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_WorriedDisk">{0} is almost full ({1}% free)!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Sleepy1">Zzz… wake me when you're back.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Sleepy2">Zzz…</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Wake">Welcome back!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Offline1">The network is gone?!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Offline2">No connection… should we look at the Network page?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Online">Phew, the network is back!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Relief">That's better.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_MenuHide">Hide Mazu</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set_ShowMascot">Show Mazu, the mascot, on the desktop (bottom right, always on top)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Set_ShowMascotNote">Mazu reacts to CPU, memory, disk, network and idle time, and keeps sampling CPU and memory once a second while shown, even when the window is in the tray. Turn it off for zero background activity. Drag it anywhere, click it to chat, right-click to hide.</sys:String>

    <!-- more lines so Mazu does not repeat itself -->
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Hello2">Mazu reporting for duty! Snacks: free RAM.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Hello3">Hello! I'm Mazu, and yes, I'm a slime. No, I can't talk about it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Happy3">I'm a slime, not a screensaver. But I can do both.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Happy4">Fun fact: zero bytes were harmed today.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Happy5">Poke me again, I dare you.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Happy6">Have you tried turning yourself off and on again? Kidding. Stay!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Ticklish">Okay okay, that tickles!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Tired3">Something is working overtime here. Union rules, you know.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Tired4">My fans… wait, I don't have fans. I still feel it!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Tired5">Is it a game, a browser with 47 tabs, or both?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_WorriedRam2">Memory is {0}% full. Maybe close a few of those tabs?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_WorriedRam3">{0}% memory… I'm getting squished!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_WorriedDisk2">{0} has only {1}% left. Time to delete that 2019 installer folder?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_WorriedDisk3">{0} is nearly full ({1}% free). I can't eat any more files!</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Sleepy3">Zzz… five more minutes…</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Sleepy4">Zzz… dreaming of free RAM…</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Sleepy5">Zzz… I'm not sleeping, I'm just resting my eyes.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Wake2">You're back! I only blinked, I swear.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Wake3">Oh! I was totally awake.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Offline3">Did somebody trip over the router again?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Offline4">The internet left without saying goodbye.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Online2">And we're back online. I never doubted it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Relief2">Ahh, breathing room.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Mascot_Relief3">Crisis over. I was very calm. Very.</sys:String>

</ResourceDictionary>
